  "body": "## Summary\nSeeding `lastETWAPBaseSupply` to zero during market init will cause a denial of service for depositors as the first minter to cross the `noCapLimit` threshold will permanently trip the mint cap until the ETWAP decays.\n\n## Root Cause\nIn `src/lex/latentswap/LatentSwapLEX.sol:268` the exchange state seeds `lastETWAPBaseSupply` to `0`, and the first mint does not update the stored exponential TWAP before `_checkMintCap` enforces limits. Combined with `_checkMintCap` in `src/lex/latentswap/libraries/LatentSwapLogic.sol:1054`, the system compares the live supply against a near-zero TWAP, so any follow-up mint after the threshold must fail until the ETWAP catches up.\n\n\n1. Market init seeds ETWAP to zero:\n```solidity\nlexState[marketId] = LexState({\n    lastBaseTokenPrice: currentBasePrice,\n    lastDebtNotionalPrice: FixedPoint.WAD,\n    lastLnRateBias: _initLnRateBias,\n    lastETWAPBaseSupply: 0,\n    lastSqrtPriceX96: uint160(FixedPoint.Q96),\n    lastUpdateTimestamp: uint96(block.timestamp)\n});\n```\n   *Stored ETWAP starts at `0` even though the next mint will add liquidity.*\n\n2. First large mint updates live supply but ETWAP stays ≈0:\n```solidity\n(currentState, ...) = LatentSwapLogic.mintLogic(...);\ncurrentState.lexState.lastETWAPBaseSupply // still ≈ 0 because update uses pre-mint supply\n```\n   *During `_calculateMarketState`, the TWAP update runs before the mint adds to `baseTokenSupply`, so the exponential moving average remains near zero.*\n\n3. Subsequent mint is capped against the stale ETWAP:\n```solidity\n_checkMintCap(\n    marketState.baseTokenSupply,\n    marketState.lexState.lastETWAPBaseSupply,\n    baseTokenAmountIn,\n    marketState.lexConfig.noCapLimit\n);\n```\n   *`marketState.baseTokenSupply` now exceeds `1 << noCapLimit`, but `lastETWAPBaseSupply` is still ≈0, making the condition `marketBaseTokenSupply + mintAmount <= lastETWAPBaseSupply << 1` impossible and reverting with `E_LEX_MintCapExceeded`.*\n\n4. ETWAP only recovers with a 30-minute half-life:\n```solidity\nvars.invUpdateFactor = DebtMath.calculateApproxExponentialUpdate(\n    LN2,\n    vars.elapsedTime,\n    ETWAP_MIN_HALF_LIFE\n);\n```\n   *Even a manual `updateState` call takes ~30 minutes to grow ETWAP by 50%, leaving the market effectively frozen in the interim.*\n\n\n## Impact\nNew deposits are blocked for roughly an hour each time someone adds just over one token, preventing organic liquidity growth.\n\n## Mitigation\nSeed `lastETWAPBaseSupply` with the first mint’s post-action supply (or skip cap enforcement until ETWAP reflects at least the live supply). For example:\n```solidity\nif (lexState.lastETWAPBaseSupply == 0 && marketState.baseTokenSupply > 0) {\n    currentState.lexState.lastETWAPBaseSupply = marketState.baseTokenSupply;\n}\n```\n*Executed after the mint calculation, this ensures the ETWAP baseline matches reality before caps apply.*",
  "proof_of_concept": "- test/LatentSwapLEX.t.sol\n```solidity\n    function test_mint_cap_freezes_market_after_first_large_mint() external {\n        LatentSwapLEX latentSwapLEX = new LatentSwapLEX(\n            address(this),\n            address(this),\n            P_MAX,\n            P_MIN,\n            P_LIM_H,\n            P_LIM_MAX,\n            LN_RATE_BIAS,\n            DURATION,\n            SWAP_FEE\n        );\n\n        MarketParams memory marketParams = MarketParams({\n            baseToken: _mockBaseAsset,\n            quoteToken: _mockQuoteAsset,\n            curator: _mockOracle,\n            lex: address(latentSwapLEX)\n        });\n\n        MarketId marketId = MarketId.wrap(bytes20(uint160(uint256(keccak256(abi.encode(marketParams))))));\n        latentSwapLEX.initMarket(marketId, marketParams, 0, hex\"\");\n\n        uint256 firstMintAmount = 2e18; // > 1 << default noCapLimit (≈1.15 tokens)\n        MintParams memory mintParams = MintParams({\n            marketId: marketId,\n            marketParams: marketParams,\n            baseAmountIn: firstMintAmount,\n            to: address(this),\n            minATokenAmountOut: 0,\n            minZTokenAmountOut: 0,\n            data: hex\"\",\n            msgValue: 0\n        });\n\n        latentSwapLEX.mint(mintParams, address(this), 0);\n\n        uint256 followUpMintAmount = 0.1e18;\n        mintParams.baseAmountIn = followUpMintAmount;\n\n        vm.expectRevert(LSErrors.E_LEX_MintCapExceeded.selector);\n        latentSwapLEX.mint(mintParams, address(this), firstMintAmount);\n\n        vm.warp(block.timestamp + 30 minutes);\n        latentSwapLEX.updateState(marketId, marketParams, firstMintAmount, hex\"\");\n\n        vm.expectRevert(LSErrors.E_LEX_MintCapExceeded.selector);\n        latentSwapLEX.mint(mintParams, address(this), firstMintAmount);\n\n        vm.warp(block.timestamp + 30 minutes);\n        latentSwapLEX.updateState(marketId, marketParams, firstMintAmount, hex\"\");\n\n        latentSwapLEX.mint(mintParams, address(this), firstMintAmount);\n    }\n\n```",
